    CARINA @ talk "Sou Carina Calworth, a dona deste estabelecimento e de mais alguns."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:75
translate ptBR qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_673f5e40:

