    CARINA @ talk "É bem simples, Capitã Nyx e eu temos um... {i}acordo.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:100
translate ptBR qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_cf19f942:

    # CARINA @ talk "She ignores some of the businesses, and I supply her with the necessary information about the real goings on of the city."
    CARINA @ talk "Ela ignora alguns dos negócios, e eu forneço a ela as informações necessárias sobre o que realmente acontece na cidade."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:101
translate ptBR qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_2fc732a7:

    # MC @ serious "And you're telling me this because...?"
    MC @ serious "E está me contando isso porque...?"

